perience with Git, GitFlow;</li>\n\t<li>Attention to detail and ability to analyze complex software systems for quality assurance purposes;</li>\n\t<li>Strong problem-solving skills and ability to troubleshoot issues effectively;</li>\n\t<li>Knowledge of the software development life cycle (SDLC) and understanding of Agile methodologies;</li>\n\t<li>Excellent communication and coordination skills (Upper-intermediate English is required);</li>\n\t<li>Ability to thrive in a fast-paced, remote environment;</li>\n\t<li>Comfortable with ambiguity with the ability to build structure and take a proactive approach to drive results.</li>\n</ul>\n<em><strong>The following additional skills would be beneficial:</strong></em>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Willingness to grow in the automation area. We offer an opportunity to transition into an automated QA role alongside manual testing responsibilities;</li>\n\t<li>Experience in writing and executing automated test scripts;</li>\n\t<li>Knowledge of one or more of the following technologies: Data Science, Business Intelligence, and Data Visualization;</li>\n\t<li>Experience with Python, JavaScript.</li>\n</ul>\n<em><strong>What you will do:</strong></em><br>\nThe successful candidate will join a diverse team to:\n<ul>\n\t<li>Planning, driving, and prioritizing testing activities on different stages and environments;</li>\n\t<li>Participate in building unique high-impact business solutions utilizing advanced technologies for use by world-class clients;</li>\n\t<li>Develop comprehensive testing documentation for internal and external use (test plans, test cases, test scenarios, test results, and test reports);</li>\n\t<li>Execute manual test cases to validate the functionality, usability, and performance of the system on the client and client environments;</li>\n\t<li>Perform ongoing regression testing to ensure the stability and reliability of the software;</li>\n\t<li>Identify root causes of issues and document mitigation acceptance criteria;<