e=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Knowledge in Docker and K8s, Terraform, etc;</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Experience with Great Expectations would be a plus.</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:italic\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Responsibilities:</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Analyze data from various sources to support decision-making and product development;</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Develop documentation for data processes and results, ensuring that documentation standards are maintained;</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Create and maintain functional specifications;</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Collaborate with product owners, client services, and engineering teams to provide actionable insights;</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Use SQL and other database tools to review, test, and manage complex data sets and models;</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Participate in the development and refinement of client's products, ensuring data integrity and accuracy;</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Liaise with different teams to ensure alignment between the technical team and business objectives;</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Collaborate with the technical team to improve data visualization and user experience;</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Manage timely delivery of data-related tasks and projects;</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Participate in regular SDLC activities including estimation, status reporting, SCRUM sessions, and design meetings.</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<div style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><em><strong>Benefits from 8allocate:</strong></em></div>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Team & Culture: Team events, offsites, and a culture that keeps people connected.</li>\n\t<li>Learning & Development: Budget for courses, certifications, and conferences.</li>\n\t<li>Wellbeing: Flexible support in line with company policy, with options to support your physical and mental wellbeing (sport, mental health, or medical insurance).</li>\n\t<li>Rest & Recovery: Paid vacation and sick leave.</li>\n</ul>\n<br>\n ","regionGroupSelected":false,"industry":"IT","priority":"medium","jbTop":true,"jbTopGroup":"Technology/Engineering/Development"}],"Business/System Analyst":[{"vacancyId":"1ccc820d5976467a90388077d74018da","localId":"3ONpJV","position":"Business/System Analyst","employmentType":"fullEmployment","workCondition":"remote","relocationSupport":false,"status":"inwork","experience":"e5_5years","role":"Senior","currency":"USD","orgId":"3f2a04d5c0204bf2ae25ad8c14ca7df9","dc":1790007048465,"dm":1795113166644,"descr":"<p><em><strong>About the client:</strong></em></p>\n\n<p>The client provides solutions that leverage sophisticated machine learning, artificial intelligence (ontologies, inference engines, and rules), and natural language processing to provide highly actionable insights and recommendations to business users. Today, their solutions impact just about every aspect of the products you buy at your local store – from what is available to how it's priced and even where it is placed on the shelf. Their SolaaS (Solution as a Service) solutions are deployed within private clouds – principally on Azure. Our client helps transform market-leading companies into true data-driven digital enterprises.</p>\n\n<p><em><strong>Stage:</strong></em> existing.<br>\n<em><strong>Timezone requirements:</strong></em> Europe working time is ok, the client is in EST, and our team is in Europe.<br>\n<em><strong>English:</strong></em> upper-intermediate+</p>\n\n<p><em><strong>Requirements:</strong></em></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>5+ years of hands-on experience as a Systems Analyst or Business Systems Analyst in a software product company;</li>\n\t<li>Experience eliciting, documenting, and maintaining functional, non-functional, and technical requirements, user stories, and specifications;</li>\n\t<li>Experience managing product roadmaps, prioritizing initiatives, and coordinating feature delivery across cross-functional teams;</li>\n\t<li>Experience delivering software features end-to-end, from requirements elicitation through implementation, UAT, and production release;</li>\n\t<li>Hands-on experience defining requirements for REST API integrations and collaborating closely with engineering teams throughout implementation;</li>\n\t<li>Solid understanding of the software development lifecycle (SDLC), version control, and CI/CD tools (e.g., Jira, Bitbucket);</li>\n\t<li>Hands-on experience working with relational databases and writing SQL queries to analyze data and validate business requirements;</li>\n\t<li>Experience with visualization tools (e.g. draw.io, Figma, MS Visio etc.)</li>\n\t<li>Understanding of cloud environments (e.g. Azure, GCP, AWS);</li>\n\t<li>Excellent communication skills with both business and technical stakeholders and ability to lead requirements elicitation sessions;</li>\n\t<li>Ability to work independently in a fast-paced, remote environment;</li>\n\t<li>Strong attention to detail with a proactive and structured approach to problem-solving;</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><em><strong>Would be a plus:</strong></em></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Experience with Figma;</li>\n\t<li>Bachelor's degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering, or a related field.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><em><strong>What you will do:</strong></em></p>\n\n<p>The ideal candidate must be collaborative, detail-oriented, and deadline-driven. Because of the nature of our work and our technology, successful candidates must take a growth mindset and be comfortable with ambiguity, with the ability to take a proactive, structured approach to achieve results. Results-oriented and deadline-driven are critical in our fast-paced environment.</p>\n\n<p>The successful candidate will join a diverse team to:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Develop the functional specifications required to enhance our existing solutions and build new solutions;</li>\n\t<li>Work collaboratively with data architects and engineers to ensure intended outcomes are achieved during solution development</li>\n\t<li>Support existing documentation in Confluence as well as prepare new articles with features</li>\n\t<li>Conduct feature testing to ensure functional changes are accurate</li>\n\t<li>Collaborate with stakeholders to understand and document requirements;</li>\n\t<li>Support Client Services team with ongoing questions and development of training materials for end users;</li>\n\t<li>Contribute to the structure and design of solution components;</li>\n\t<li>Manage the project deliverables in a timely manner;</li>\n\t<li>Help build a user-friendly and high-quality software solution.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><em><strong>Benefits from 8allocate:</strong></em></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Team & Culture: Team events, offsites, and a culture that keeps people connected.</li>\n\t<li>Learning & Development: Budget for courses, certifications, and conferences.</li>\n\t<li>Wellbeing: Flexible support in line with company policy, with options to support your physical and mental wellbeing (sport, mental health, or medical insurance).</li>\n\t<li>Rest & Recovery: Paid vacation and sick leave.</li>\n</ul>\n","regionGroupSelected":false,"industry":"IT","priority":"medium","jbTop":false}],"Head of Outbound (Head of Lead Generation)":[{"vacancyId":"693b70d823b840b28fea9394997b1ad1","localId":"JAYHUe","position":"Head of Outbound (Head of Lead Generation)","employmentType":"fullEmployment","workCondition":"remote","relocationSupport":false,"status":"inwork","experience":"e5_5years","role":"Lead","currency":"USD","orgId":"3f2a04d5c0204bf2ae25ad8c14ca7df9","dc":1793626940754,"dm":1795080165893,"descr":"<p><em><strong>About the role:</strong></em></p>\n\n<p>We’re looking for a Head of Outbound to build and run a repeatable client acquisition system for 8allocate across our priority markets.<br>\nYou’ll be responsible for the whole lead-generation process: choosing which companies to approach, planning campaigns, managing the team, and making sure the meetings we arrange lead to real sales opportunities. We need someone who has built this process before and is comfortable doing the work as well as managing it. You should be able to write a good message, review a prospect’s reply, launch a campaign, and help your team improve. You’ll work closely with Marketing, Solutions, and our CTO office to understand what we can offer and which clients are most likely to need it.</p>\n\n<ul>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong><em>Requirements:</em></strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>7+ years of experience in B2B sales, lead generation, or outbound, including 3+ years managing a Lead Generation or SDR team.</li>\n\t<li>Experience in IT services with a good understanding of how companies choose and buy technology services.</li>\n\t<li>Experience generating leads for software development, data, or AI services.</li>\n\t<li>Experience building or improving a lead-generation process, with concrete results you can discuss.</li>\n\t<li>Experience working with the US, UK, or European markets.</li>\n\t<li>Strong written English and the ability to write clear, relevant outreach messages.</li>\n\t<li>Practical experience with prospecting and outreach tools such as Sales Navigator, Apollo, Clay, Snov.io or Reply.io. You don’t need to know every tool, but you should know how to choose and use the right ones.</li>\n\t<li>A good understanding of email deliverability and outreach infrastructure.</li>\n\t<li>Experience using AI and automation to support research, campaign preparation and everyday team tasks.</li>\n\t<li>Confidence working with CRM systems, campaign data and budgets, including advanced practical experience with HubSpot.</li>\n\t<li>The ability to give constructive feedback, develop people and take responsibility when results fall short.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><em><strong>Nice to have:</strong></em></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Experience with account-based campaigns, events, partnerships or referrals.</li>\n\t<li>Experience with Make, Zapier or n8n.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><em><strong>Responsibilities:</strong></em></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Develop and manage our lead-generation plan for the US, UK, MENA, APAC markets.</li>\n\t<li>Identify target industries, companies and decision-makers together with the Pre-Sales and Solutions unit.</li>\n\t<li>Lead, coach and develop the SDR team. Set clear goals and help people achieve them.</li>\n\t<li>Plan and launch campaigns across email, LinkedIn and other relevant channels. Review messaging, targeting and follow-ups regularly.</li>\n\t<li>Agree with Sales and Pre-Sales what makes a lead qualified and what information should be collected before a meeting. Follow up on the outcome so the team understands which leads turn into opportunities and why others do not.</li>\n\t<li>Test new approaches, review the results and decide which ones are worth continuing.</li>\n\t<li>Choose and manage the tools the team needs, including contact databases, outreach platforms and automation. Take care of data quality and email deliverability.</li>\n\t<li>Manage the lead-generation budget and track the cost and results of campaigns.</li>\n\t<li>Keep CRM records and reporting accurate. Give the team and management a clear view of results, problems and next steps.</li>\n\t<li>Work with Marketing and Solutions on campaigns around events, target accounts, partnerships and referrals.</li>\n\t<li>We’ll look at the quality of the opportunities your team brings in, how they progress with Sales and the cost of generating them. The number of messages sent or meetings booked will not be enough on its own.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><em><strong>Benefits from 8allocate:</strong></em></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Team & Culture: Team events, offsites, and a culture that keeps people connected.</li>\n\t<li>Learning & Development: Budget for courses, certifications, and conferences.</li>\n\t<li>Wellbeing: Flexible support in line with company policy, with options to support your physical and mental wellbeing (sport, mental health, or medical insurance).</li>\n\t<li>Rest & Recovery: Paid vacation and sick leave.</li>\n</ul>\n","regionGroupSelected":false,"industry":"IT","priority":"medium","jbTop":true,"jbTopGroup":"Sales/BizDev"}],"Digital Marketing Manager":[{"vacancyId":"3693bc71195e4a538b3e0e7a4e05fbbf","localId":"c14AhI","position":"Digital Marketing Manager","employmentType":"fullEmployment","workCondition":"remote","relocationSupport":false,"status":"inwork","experience":"e5_5years","role":"Lead","currency":"USD","orgId":"3f2a04d5c0204bf2ae25ad8c14ca7df9","dc":1789980501185,"dm":1795078864969,"descr":"<p><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"><strong>8allocate</strong> is a digital engineering and AI company that designs, builds, and modernizes software products, data platforms, and operational systems for international clients.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Founded in 2015 and headquartered in Estonia, the company operates through distributed engineering teams across Europe and Latin America.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Join 8allocate as a Digital Marketing Manager and become the driving force behind our revenue growth engine. In this role, you will own the full demand generation strategy — from account-based marketing and paid acquisition to events, automation, and AI-powered marketing operations. You will work closely with Sales and Solutions to build a predictable pipeline, launch go-to-market initiatives, and turn marketing into a measurable commercial function. We value hands-on execution, data-driven decision-making, and business impact over marketing activity for its own sake.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:italic\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Cooperation: </span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Long-term.</span></span></span></span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:italic\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">English:</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> </span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Advanced level.</span></span></span></span></span></span><br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:italic\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Requirements:</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">7+ years of experience in B2B demand generation, growth marketing, field marketing, or revenue marketing.</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Experience in technology services, software development, AI, or consulting.</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Master's degree in marketing, business, economics, analytics, or a related field.</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Hands-on, personal experience running campaigns on a CRM, a marketing automation/ABM platform, and an analytics stack.</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Hands-on experience building automation workflows (</span></span></span></span></span></span><a href=\"http://make.com/\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#3392ea\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Make.com</span></span></span></span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">, n8n, Zapier, or equivalent) and using AI tools (Claude, GPT, etc) for content, research, reporting, etc.</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Experience working closely with sales and commercial teams, with pipeline/revenue as a shared number, not a marketing-only metric.</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Experience with website relaunch, solution packaging, or new go-to-market initiatives.</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Ability to work with different markets, cultures, industries, verticals, buyer personas, and company sizes.</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Strong project management and execution skills.</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Analytical and systems-thinking mindset.</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Ability to communicate clearly with leadership, sales, solutions, clients, partners, and external vendors.</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Excellent written and verbal English.</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">AI is a core requirement for this role. You should know how to apply AI, automation, and workflow orchestration to solve business problems, improve marketing performance, and create measurable impact. We are looking for practical implementation experience, not tool experimentation.</span></span></span></span></span></span><br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:italic\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Nice to have:</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Experience in a company going through transformation or repositioning.</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:italic\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Responsibilities:</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Developing and executing demand generation programs across paid (search, LinkedIn/social), organic (SEO, content), and outbound (ABM, email, direct outreach) channels.</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Supporting company positioning, messaging, and go-to-market initiatives.</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Conducting market, competitor, and customer research to identify opportunities, trends, and growth areas.</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Working closely with the Business Units to identify promising verticals, refine offerings, and improve product-market fit.</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Building and managing campaigns that generate a qualified pipeline - every campaign tied to a pipeline or revenue target.</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Driving account-based marketing initiatives against a named target account list.</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Planning and executing conference and roadshow presence: venue/booth strategy, speaker submissions, pre-event target-account outreach, on-site meeting scheduling, and post-event pipeline follow-up.</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1c1f23\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Suppor